{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_title", "source_sha256": "94d1cc0ddec7b0def7a59b8ce3f175ae02dc005d794884e9c7ecd3f543aeed16", "ja": "美咲の留守電2", "zh": "美咲的电话留言2", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "80f5c5b32391da3100dcabaa1d124e2fe17e961e472b7f50d9689ff2fd79ba90", "ja": "青羽美咲からの、ある日の留守番電話です。", "zh": "这是来自青羽美咲某天的电话留言。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "2e9bf2e64d54a78bb20f6bf4d794887efe1c3c23f49475db1fb4e2e08d3028fe", "ja": "もしもし、{$P$}さん。\n青羽美咲です。", "zh": "喂，{$P$}先生。\n我是青羽美咲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "c4e57fd2c05461d26091937ff0d00ae15340e93215c31412b381bbf0acebf1a4", "ja": "まだお仕事中ですよね？\nお忙しいところ、ごめんなさい。", "zh": "您还在工作吧？\n在您忙的时候打扰了，真是抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "c2a00ad7de304b0768d21652268cf2046d83733c4137bc461df06ca32a931101", "ja": "じつは、このみさん達に食事に誘ってもらって。\n{$P$}さんも、と思ったんですけど…", "zh": "其实，是琴叶她们邀请我一起吃饭来着。我也想叫上{$P$}先生，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "d676d83c4f14d991d71bac8fe93f54ad178447fd3ec0b5e919e39454c97afdd8", "ja": "やっぱり難しそうですね。\nえっと……ごめんなさい、行っちゃいます！", "zh": "看来还是不太走得开呢。\n那个……不好意思，我先去啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1004_102mis", "source_sha256": "112ec78ca59446874fe88c51a633fd1f6f4517e6946fdbe183aedf75784307eb", "ja": "あ、小さい子たちは、みんなもう帰りましたから、\n安心してくださいね～。", "zh": "啊，小孩子们都已经回去了，\n请放心哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1005_102mis", "source_sha256": "644ff8ff3aa5761daf213ce0bc07b05094fb84dfb13969914c4d1e77492ae3be", "ja": "それから……なんと！　冷蔵庫におやつのプリンが\nありますよ～♪　よかったら、食べてくださいね♪", "zh": "还有……您猜怎么着！冰箱里有给大家准备的布丁哦～♪要是不嫌弃的话，请吃吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "ee913b39eff6631e435c275b9922596439a207a0426aaf0b6ed99e09b1186914", "ja": "『{$P$}さんの！』って\n書いてありますから、すぐわかると思います♪", "zh": "上面写着“给{$P$}先生的！”，所以应该马上就能找到啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1007_102mis", "source_sha256": "f43218ff561014382f042a6207965c46e713fab8f8864d82c10beb503d09282e", "ja": "え？　……は～い！　分かりました～♪\nあの、このみさんから伝言で、", "zh": "诶？……好——！知道了～♪\n那个，这是木实小姐托我转告的，", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "b6351a3594925ddf7d8a7423d6a6c49bb88f3c4dd57f25ca378456e90479bffc", "ja": "「いつものお店だから」だそうです♪　……えへへ、\n合流できそうだったら来てくださいね。待ってます♪", "zh": "“说是在平时那家店”♪……嘿嘿，\n如果能和我们汇合的话，请过来哦。我们等着您♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "b1d27c8397c5701e94457a3e6189e2c121c9cee4ea6939b438b87857ea44eff8", "ja": "あ、でも、無理しないでくださいね？\nお疲れだと思いますし、またいつでも行けますし♪", "zh": "啊，不过请不要勉强自己哦？\n您应该也累了，而且以后随时都可以再去嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_661_rs_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_661_rs_01_1010_102mis", "source_sha256": "5611e82c2afa3ed62b9180adc92dfe6ee3019f320dc5a6467d569b6cd562eefc", "ja": "それじゃ、今日はすみませんけど、お先に失礼します。\nまた明日も、よろしくお願いしますね～♪", "zh": "那么，今天就先失陪了，真是不好意思。\n明天也请多多关照哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
